        ["2"] = <"Wong L, Paul E, Murday HK, Fang J, Lavender I, Coombs PR, Teoh M. Biparietal diameter measurements using the outer-to-outer versus outer-to-inner measurement: A question of pedantry? Australas J Ultrasound Med. 2018 Apr 16;21(3):161-168. doi: 10.1002/ajum.12091. PMID: 34760517; PMCID: PMC8409806.">
